{
  "id": "lined_sheet_metal_ducts___sound_attenuation",
  "title": "Lined Sheet-Metal Ducts - Sound Attenuation",
  "description": "Noise attenuation in rectangular straight, lined, sheet metal ducts. Calculate total sound attenuation based on duct dimensions, lining thickness, frequency, and duct length.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Lined Sheet-Metal Ducts - Sound Attenuation\n\nNoise attenuation in rectangular straight, lined, sheet metal ducts.\n\n## Theory\n\nAttenuation in ducts with **25 mm lining** and **50 mm lining** varies by duct dimensions and frequency.\n\n### Conversion Factors\n- 1 in = 25.4 mm\n- 1 ft = 0.3 m\n\n### Example Calculation\n\nThe sound attenuation in a 610 × 610 mm lined duct is approximately 2.5 dB/m at frequency 250 Hz. The total sound attenuation in a 10 m duct:\n\n**(10 m) × (2.5 dB/m) = 25 dB**"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Value"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "duct_width",
          "label": "Duct Width",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 610
        },
        {
          "id": "duct_height",
          "label": "Duct Height",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 610
        },
        {
          "id": "lining_thickness",
          "label": "Lining Thickness",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": 25,
              "label": "25 mm"
            },
            {
              "value": 50,
              "label": "50 mm"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 25
        },
        {
          "id": "frequency",
          "label": "Frequency",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": 125,
              "label": "125 Hz"
            },
            {
              "value": 250,
              "label": "250 Hz"
            },
            {
              "value": 500,
              "label": "500 Hz"
            },
            {
              "value": 1000,
              "label": "1000 Hz"
            },
            {
              "value": 2000,
              "label": "2000 Hz"
            },
            {
              "value": 4000,
              "label": "4000 Hz"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 250
        },
        {
          "id": "attenuation_rate",
          "label": "Attenuation Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "dB/m",
          "defaultValue": 2.5
        },
        {
          "id": "duct_length",
          "label": "Duct Length",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 10
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_attenuation",
          "label": "Total Sound Attenuation",
          "formula": "inputs.duct_length * inputs.attenuation_rate",
          "unit": "dB",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}